The entry and exit thresholds differ. That explains why crossing a major life threshold—children, war, loss, identity change—cannot necessarily be undone by restoring the old external conditions. You crossed a phase boundary; the system now has history.

Business contributes incentive embodiment

A company’s stated value is merely symbolic. Its compensation, promotion, pricing, and reporting systems are its executable incarnations.

Mechanism design asks:

\text{Which local rules make the desired global behavior an equilibrium?}

